This directory is 4b_mil_training's output tree. It is tracked while empty so that
scripts/check_resolved_paths.py can resolve `OUT / '<file>.csv'` before the notebook
has ever run -- an untracked parent makes every one of those eleven paths report as
unresolvable, which is indistinguishable from a real path defect.

Written 13.08.2026. Delete this file once the directory holds committed output.
